From 117b606f4c7e0eab034608e2cf458079777618ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RJ <rsteinhoff@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 20:20:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(replacer): add search bar to the enabled configs menu

Type to filter configs by name (case-insensitive, every word must match).
Enter toggles the first match, Escape clears the search, and the popup
shrinks to fit the results.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WpEHogr3Soi2Zbbp4iTvCd
